<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Shekhar Girdhar & Anr. v. Brij Dwivedi, FAO (COMM) 23/2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Division Bench — Justice Dinesh Mehta and Dr. Justice Aditi Choudhary (reportable)</td></tr>
